## Program Learning Outcomes

Students completing this program will be able to:

- Demonstrate comprehensive knowledge of biblical teachings.
- Apply Christian theology to personal and ministry development.
- Develop spiritual maturity and Christ-centered leadership.
- Understand Pentecostal–Charismatic beliefs and practices.
- Demonstrate biblical principles of discipleship and mentoring.
- Equip believers for Christian service and ministry leadership.
